## Limits (12 October 2026)

All GPU measurements ran on ANGLE Metal only. The outlier criterion cannot see a perturbation below one level spread over fewer than 0.1 % of the pixels, as the seventh red break showed. The arch fit is a proof on three frames at 64 x 100, not a finished reproduction of the shot. (12 October 2026)
